# Always deploy to phone

When you finish a task that changes **Flutter UI**, **sample editor**, **bridge**, or **engine** code the user will verify on device:

1. Run `.\tools\flutter_deploy.ps1` (or equivalent build + install).
2. Target device: **ZY32MCWDJ6** (moto g86 power 5G) unless the user specifies another.
3. Read shell output — confirm install succeeded before saying done.
4. If deploy fails, report the blocker; do not stop at "APK built".

Skip deploy only when the task is **read-only** (questions, reviews, docs-only) or the user explicitly says not to deploy.

Do not ask "want me to deploy?" — deploy by default.
